        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "smile",
        "text": "不过咱是小喷菇",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "smile",
        "text": "唔... 不是很厉害啦",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "confident",
        "text": "不过不过，一起战斗很有趣呢",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "star",
        "text": "感觉你真的好厉害",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "smile",
        "text": "向日葵姐姐应该也累了吧？",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "smile",
        "text": "今晚就让她休息休息吧",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "smile",
        "text": "咱让阳光菇姐姐来帮忙啦",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "confident",
        "text": "诶嘿，那就开始吧",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      }
